    "host": "resolveOwner(token); spawn({sessionId,intentId,owner,task}); inspect({sessionId,intentId,owner,handle?}); cancel(same). Host methods are outside SQLite transactions. inspect is lookup-only and cancel is idempotent intent, never implicit creation.",
